    "A new weekly summary is available. See what REBOOT learned about your focus patterns.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un nouveau résumé hebdomadaire est disponible. Voyez ce que REBOOT a appris sur vos schémas d'attention."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hay un nuevo resumen semanal. Mira qué aprendió REBOOT sobre tus patrones de atención."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine neue Wochenübersicht ist verfügbar. Sieh, was REBOOT über deine Fokusmuster gelernt hat."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "È disponibile un nuovo riepilogo settimanale. Scopri cosa ha imparato REBOOT sui tuoi schemi di attenzione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A single JSON file containing everything REBOOT knows: diagnosis answers, profile, sessions, rules, experiments, Flow projects and evidence, Fuel history, environment observations, reviews, and your Operating Manual. Nothing leaves your device except through the share sheet you control.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un seul fichier JSON avec tout ce que REBOOT sait : réponses du diagnostic, profil, séances, règles, expériences, projets et preuves Flow, historique Fuel, observations d'environnement, revues et votre Manuel. Rien ne quitte votre appareil sauf via la feuille de partage que vous contrôlez."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un único archivo JSON con todo lo que REBOOT sabe: respuestas del diagnóstico, perfil, sesiones, reglas, experimentos, proyectos y evidencia Flow, historial Fuel, observaciones del entorno, revisiones y tu Manual. Nada sale de tu dispositivo salvo por la hoja de compartir que tú controlas."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine einzige JSON-Datei mit allem, was REBOOT weiß: Diagnoseantworten, Profil, Sitzungen, Regeln, Experimente, Flow-Projekte und -Evidenz, Fuel-Verlauf, Umgebungsbeobachtungen, Reviews und dein Handbuch. Nichts verlässt dein Gerät außer über das Share-Sheet, das du steuerst."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un unico file JSON con tutto ciò che REBOOT sa: risposte della diagnosi, profilo, sessioni, regole, esperimenti, progetti ed evidenze Flow, cronologia Fuel, osservazioni d'ambiente, revisioni e il tuo Manuale. Nulla lascia il tuo dispositivo se non tramite il foglio di condivisione che controlli."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A typical day, not your best one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
