          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first week is calibration. We start with what you tell us, then REBOOT learns from what actually happens.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La première semaine sert d'étalonnage. Nous partons de ce que vous nous dites, puis REBOOT apprend de ce qui se passe vraiment."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La primera semana es de calibración. Empezamos con lo que nos cuentas y luego REBOOT aprende de lo que ocurre de verdad."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die erste Woche ist Kalibrierung. Wir starten mit dem, was du uns sagst, dann lernt REBOOT aus dem, was wirklich passiert."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La prima settimana è di calibrazione. Partiamo da quello che ci dici, poi REBOOT impara da ciò che accade davvero."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The full program continues with a subscription. Your Day 1 session and insights stay yours either way.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La suite du programme nécessite un abonnement. Votre séance du Jour 1 et vos observations restent les vôtres dans tous les cas."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El programa completo continúa con una suscripción. Tu sesión del Día 1 y sus observaciones siguen siendo tuyas de todos modos."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das volle Programm setzt mit einem Abo fort. Deine Tag-1-Sitzung und Erkenntnisse bleiben in jedem Fall deine."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il programma completo continua con un abbonamento. La sessione del Giorno 1 e le osservazioni restano tue in ogni caso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The honest one, not the most admirable one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La réponse honnête, pas la plus admirable."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La respuesta sincera, no la más admirable."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die ehrliche Antwort, nicht die bewundernswerteste."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La risposta sincera, non quella più ammirevole."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original task is usually lost": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
